Recolher!

378
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:57,270
Apagar as luzes!

379
00:19:12,660 --> 00:19:14,290
Um beijo!

380
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,960
Papai.

381
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,730
Brevemente você e eu

382
00:19:24,770 --> 00:19:27,400
